e` cannot install or switch the WebContainer","+  distribution. `pnpm pack-app` cannot run its native app builder.","+"," WebContainer's bundled npm applies its own package compatibility replacements."," This runtime does not use those private integrations. Select"," WebAssembly alternatives explicitly when a dependency normally downloads native","@@ -98,9 +106,22 @@ Automatic restoration of changed installation metadata after an error is"," unavailable because WebContainers cannot securely pin the parent directory."," pnpm reports this limitation instead of restoring through a replaced directory."," ","-Automatic provenance signing, Cargo workspace integration, `pnpm setup`,","-`pnpm self-update`, and `pnpm pack-app` are unavailable in this distribution.","-These operations fail explicitly before performing unsupported work.","+WebContainers also lack descriptor-relative directory opens for permission","+inheritance. pnpm checks each path component before opening it, so a concurrent","+rename or symlink replacement can redirect a permission change between those","+operations. Do not run pnpm in a directory tree that an untrusted process can","+modify concurrently.","+","+Automatic provenance signing is unavailable in this distribution. Cargo","+workspace integration requires the Cargo executable, which is not installed in","+WebContainers. Cargo dependency commands fail when pnpm tries to run Cargo for","+manifest discovery.","+","+The WebContainer browser network does not support explicit HTTP proxies, custom","+TLS trust roots or client identities, disabled TLS verification, or pinned","+local addresses. Commands that request these settings fail while creating the","+HTTP client, before sending a registry request. A `ca` or `cafile` setting that","+yields no certificates adds no trust roots and does not fail."," "," To update pnpm in a WebContainer, install a newer version of `@pnpm/wasm` with"," npm."],"additions":24,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnp